flowchart LR
    D[Delete request] --> W{Type?}
    W -->|fat-finger, grace window| SD[Soft delete + partial indexes]
    W -->|lifecycle| AR[Archive tables / cold storage]
    W -->|compliance PII| HD[Hard delete / anonymize]
    SD -->|grace expired| AR
    AR -->|retention expired| HD
    SD -->|restore| LIVE[(Live tables)]
